title: 3. Tantivy
pid: 43bb9505-dc61-4e52-b028-4491345ec5e4
body: |2-
  Tantivy is not given the =RepoMove= list at all. Skgrepo moves are
  applied implicitly: the search-index update is "delete every doc by ID,
  then re-add docs for every save," and the =SaveNode= carries the
  new =repo= field, so the re-added document has the correct skgrepo.
